63a4680ae2d918.avif?t=1572967400\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521580/extras/129f50f4e5349d3fc744f3087a5e5540.avif?t=1572967400\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521580/extras/412c3a81bf12aded8b05ca6ea9a42314.avif?t=1572967400\" /></div><br><br>If there is no signal, the player has to draw a fight card.<br><br>You can also tweak your dice move by using bonus cards. These are given out after you finish a circle, and sometimes also drop from the chests.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521580/extras/aa62317d4b2f8e5d66e0c102d536f1d1.avif?t=1572967400\" /></div><br><br>I hope you have a great time playing our game with hours of enjoyment, and a fun!",
